  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Inspecting CSS Configuration**\n\nOkay, I\'ve started by checking `src/index.css`. Currently, it only contains `@import \"tailwindcss\";`. My next step is to configure Tailwind CSS styles, specifically custom utilities for the parchment paper texture, book fonts, and some aesthetic touches. I\'m thinking of using `@theme` variables for fonts and colors, similar to Tailwind v4.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_1104189"
      name: "create_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Content\":\"@import \\\"tailwindcss\\\";\\n\\n@theme {\\n  --font-serif: \\\"Cormorant Garamond\\\", Georgia, Cambria, \\\"Times New Roman\\\", Times, serif;\\n  --font-display: \\\"Cinzel\\\", Georgia, serif;\\n  --font-book: \\\"Lora\\\", Georgia, serif;\\n  --font-sans: \\\"Plus Jakarta Sans\\\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, sans-serif;\\n  --font-mono: \\\"JetBrains Mono\\\", monospace;\\n\\n  --color-parchment-50: #FCFBF9;\\n  --color-parchment-100: #F8F6F0;\\n  --color-parchment-200: #F0EDE1;\\n  --color-parchment-300: #E6E1D1;\\n  --color-parchment-400: #D8D1BD;\\n  --color-parchment-500: #C4BBA1;\\n\\n  --color-moss-50: #F4F7F2;\\n  --color-moss-100: #E5EDE1;\\n  --color-moss-600: #385E38;\\n  --color-moss-700: #2C4B2C;\\n  --color-moss-800: #203821;\\n  --color-moss-900: #162617;\\n\\n  --color-forest-900: #17281A;\\n  --color-forest-950: #0F1C11;\\n\\n  --color-earth-600: #8D5B3A;\\n  --color-earth-700: #734528;\\n  --color-terracotta: #A44A32;\\n  --color-antique-ink: #23201D;\\n  --color-caption-sepia: #685F53;\\n}\\n\\n/* Custom delicate naturalist paper background */\\n.bg-parchment {\\n  background-color: #F8F6F0;\\n  background-image: \\n    radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(245, 240, 228, 0.4) 0%, rgba(235, 227, 210, 0.6) 100%),\\n    radial-gradient(ellipse at top left, rgba(74, 103, 65, 0.04) 0%, transparent 60%),\\n    radial-gradient(ellipse at bottom right, rgba(164, 74, 50, 0.03) 0%, transparent 60%);\\n}\\n\\n.bg-field-card {\\n  background-color: #FBF9F4;\\n  border: 1px solid rgba(196, 187, 161, 0.5);\\n  box-shadow: 0 2px 8px -2px rgba(44, 40, 36, 0.05), 0 1px 2px rgba(44, 40, 36, 0.03);\\n}\\n\\n.paper-edge {\\n  box-shadow: \\n    0 1px 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.04), \\n    0 2px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.04), \\n    0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.04),\\n    inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(196, 187, 161, 0.4);\\n}\\n\\n.naturalist-border {\\n  border: 1px solid #D8D1BD;\\n  position: relative;\\n}\\n\\n.naturalist-border::after {\\n  content: \'\';\\n  position: absolute;\\n  inset: 3px;\\n  border: 1px solid rgba(216, 209, 189, 0.4);\\n  pointer-events: none;\\n}\\n\\n/* Smooth scrolling */\\nhtml {\\n  scroll-behavior: smooth;\\n}\\n\\n/* Custom scrollbars that match the antique parchment */\\n::-webkit-scrollbar {\\n  width: 8px;\\n  height: 8px;\\n}\\n::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\\n  background: #F0EDE1;\\n}\\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\\n  background: #C4BBA1;\\n  border-radius: 4px;\\n}\\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\\n  background: #A99E81;\\n}\\n\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/index.css\", \"toolAction\":\"Styling index.css\", \"toolSummary\":\"Configure natural history styles and fonts in index.css\"}"
      thought_signature: ""
      original_name: "create_file"
    }
