  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing Zoology Types**\n\nI\'m currently working on defining the core data structures and types for the zoology module. Specifically, I\'m fleshing out `src/types/zoology.ts`. So far, I\'ve created the `PhylumId` union type and the `Phylum` interface with `id`, `name`, and `commonName` properties. I\'m focusing on creating a robust foundation for handling different animal phyla and their related information.\n\n\n**Expanding Phylum Definitions**\n\nI\'ve significantly expanded the `Phylum` interface. I\'ve integrated details like etymology, short descriptions, and overviews. There\'s now a section dedicated to general characteristics covering various biological aspects, along with an \"at a glance\" summary. I am also planning on including specimen and anatomical information, which I will begin to design shortly.\n\n\n**Defining Animal Detail Fields**\n\nI\'m now integrating detailed fields for individual animal entries. I\'ve expanded the structure significantly, adding properties for scientific names, classifications, habitats, morphologies, and more. This includes anatomy details, nutrition information, and reproduction specifics. I\'ve also incorporated features like \"interesting facts,\" and quiz questions for knowledge assessment.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_1187913"
      name: "create_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Content\":\"export type PhylumId = \\n  | \'porifera\' \\n  | \'cnidaria\' \\n  | \'ctenophora\' \\n  | \'platyhelminthes\' \\n  | \'nemathelminthes\';\\n\\nexport interface ClassificationHierarchy {\\n  kingdom: string;\\n  phylum: string;\\n  subphylumOrSuperclass?: string;\\n  class: string;\\n  order: string;\\n  family?: string;\\n  genus: string;\\n  species: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface AnatomicalFlow {\\n  title: string;\\n  path: string[];\\n  description: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface Specimen {\\n  id: string;\\n  commonName: string;\\n  scientificName: string;\\n  phylumId: PhylumId;\\n  classification: ClassificationHierarchy;\\n  shortDescription: string;\\n  identification: string;\\n  habitat: string;\\n  morphology: string;\\n  anatomy: string;\\n  nutrition: string;\\n  reproduction: string;\\n  lifeCycle?: string;\\n  specialFeatures: string;\\n  importance: string;\\n  interestingFacts: string[];\\n  examPoints: string[];\\n  spotlightQuote: string;\\n  accessionNo: string;\\n  anatomicalFlow?: AnatomicalFlow;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface PhylumGeneralCharacteristics {\\n  bodyOrganization: string;\\n  symmetry: string;\\n  levelOfOrganization: string;\\n  germLayers: string;\\n  coelom: string;\\n  bodyWall: string;\\n  canalOrCavity: string;\\n  digestion: string;\\n  respiration: string;\\n  excretion: string;\\n  nervousSystem: string;\\n  reproduction: string;\\n  skeleton: string;\\n  ecologicalImportance: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface PhylumAtAGlance {\\n  kingdom: string;\\n  phylum: string;\\n  organization: string;\\n  symmetry: string;\\n  habitat: string;\\n  germLayers: string;\\n  coelom: string;\\n  examples: string[];\\n}\\n\\nexport interface Phylum {\\n  id: PhylumId;\\n  name: string;\\n  commonName: string;\\n  etymology: string;\\n  shortDescription: string;\\n  overview: string;\\n  generalCharacteristics: PhylumGeneralCharacteristics;\\n  atAGlance: PhylumAtAGlance;\\n  specimenIds: string[];\\n  revisionPoints: string[];\\n  anatomicalDiagram?: {\\n    title: string;\\n    description: string;\\n    stepsOrParts: { name: string; description: string }[];\\n  };\\n}\\n\\nexport interface QuizQuestion {\\n  id: string;\\n  question: string;\\n  options: string[];\\n  correctIndex: number;\\n  explanation: string;\\n  phylumId?: PhylumId;\\n  specimenId?: string;\\n  type: \'mcq\' | \'identify_phylum\' | \'spotter\' | \'true_false\';\\n}\\n\\nexport interface SpecimenImageEntry {\\n  primary: string;\\n  plate: string;\\n  caption: string;\\n  credit?: string;\\n}\\n\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/types/zoology.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating zoology types\", \"toolSummary\":\"Define TypeScript interfaces for zoology entities\"}"
      thought_signature: ""
      original_name: "create_file"
    }
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 3
      nanos: 404668494
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
    provider_assigned_message_id: "VQC4ar78CIn5qtsPyPeGsAs"
  }
