  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing Digital Zoology**\n\nOkay, I\'m now focusing on creating the digital field guide components. First up, I\'m outlining the `Navbar`. The top bar will feature a brand zone displaying \"NON-CHORDATA\" or \"Natural History Field Guide.\" I\'m also thinking through the nav links: Home, Phyla, Specimens, Explore, Classification Tree, and Field Guide.\n\n\n**Adding Interactive Elements**\n\nI\'ve been concentrating on interactive elements like search functionality with a modal dropdown and a responsive mobile menu to improve usability. The design for the hero section is shaping up, featuring visual elements, main titles, and supporting text, along with a \"Explore the Phyla\" call-to-action. I\'m also deep into designing the `PhylumCard` and `PhylumGrid`, envisioning interactive cards with detailed descriptions, specimen counts, and \"Explore Phylum\" buttons. Finally, I\'m developing the `PhylumDetail` section with a full set of characteristics.\n\n\n**Developing Specimen Details**\n\nI\'m now completely immersed in creating detailed specimen views, concentrating on the `SpecimenCard` first. I\'m aiming for a natural history label aesthetic, with a clean and informative layout. The `SpecimenDetail` view is getting complex, with high-resolution images, full classifications, and a ton of detailed information including anatomy, ecology, and interesting facts. I\'m planning to make interactive anatomical flowcharts as well, with detailed elements. Finally, the `ExploreView` is taking shape with filtering and search functionality.\n\n\n**Expanding Interactive Features**\n\nI\'m now adding a \"Specimen of the Day\" feature, randomly or selectively displayed. I\'m also implementing a Specimen Compare tool for side-by-side comparisons. I am working on the `ClassificationTree` which will feature an interactive phylogenetic tree of Non-Chordata, allowing for node clicks to reveal taxonomic diagnostics. I\'m also planning the `FieldGuideView`, aiming for a vintage naturalist field journal experience. Finally, I\'m sketching out the `QuizView` and `RevisionView`, with various quiz formats and revision cards.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_1374301"
      name: "create_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Content\":\"import React, { useState } from \'react\';\\n\\ninterface NaturalistImageProps {\\n  src: string;\\n  fallbackSrc?: string;\\n  alt: string;\\n  caption?: string;\\n  className?: string;\\n  containerClassName?: string;\\n  showCaption?: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nexport const NaturalistImage: React.FC<NaturalistImageProps> = ({\\n  src,\\n  fallbackSrc = \'/src/assets/images/field_guide_hero_1790443534569.jpg\',\\n  alt,\\n  caption,\\n  className = \'\',\\n  containerClassName = \'\',\\n  showCaption = false,\\n}) => {\\n  const [currentSrc, setCurrentSrc] = useState(src);\\n  const [hasError, setHasError] = useState(false);\\n  const [loaded, setLoaded] = useState(false);\\n\\n  const handleError = () => {\\n    if (!hasError && fallbackSrc && currentSrc !== fallbackSrc) {\\n      setCurrentSrc(fallbackSrc);\\n      setHasError(true);\\n    } else {\\n      setHasError(true);\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  return (\\n    <figure className={`relative overflow-hidden ${containerClassName}`}>\\n      <div className=\\\"relative w-full h-full bg-[#EAE5D9] overflow-hidden\\\">\\n        {/* Subtle paper grain / placeholder texture */}\\n        {!loaded && (\\n          <div className=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-[#EFECE3] flex items-center justify-center text-[#8C8270] text-xs font-serif italic animate-pulse\\\">\\n            Loading natural history specimen...\\n          </div>\\n        )}\\n        \\n        <img\\n          src={currentSrc}\\n          alt={alt}\\n          referrerPolicy=\\\"no-referrer\\\"\\n          loading=\\\"lazy\\\"\\n          onLoad={() => setLoaded(true)}\\n          onError={handleError}\\n          className={`w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 ease-out ${className}`}\\n        />\\n        \\n        {/* Delicate naturalist inner vignette */}\\n        <div className=\\\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none ring-1 ring-inset ring-black/10\\\" />\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {showCaption && caption && (\\n        <figcaption className=\\\"mt-2 text-xs font-serif italic text-[#685F53] leading-relaxed border-l-2 border-[#C4BBA1] pl-2.5\\\">\\n          {caption}\\n        </figcaption>\\n      )}\\n    </figure>\\n  );\\n};\\n\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/NaturalistImage.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating NaturalistImage component\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create resilient image component with naturalist styling\"}"
      thought_signature: ""
      original_name: "create_file"
    }
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 5
      nanos: 9596922
    }
