  planner_response {
    response: "The Field Guide section has been updated to correctly load and display every specimen\'s image:\n\n1. **Reactive Image Synchronization (`NaturalistImage.tsx`)**:\n   - Added `useEffect` listening to changes in `src` and `fallbackSrc`, ensuring that when flipping through specimens, the image container immediately loads the newly selected specimen\'s image rather than retaining the initial mount state.\n\n2. **Visual Folio Integration (`FieldGuidePage.tsx`)**:\n   - Wired each specimen plate directly to its respective image in `specimenImages` (`src/data/images.ts`).\n   - Added keyed re-mounting (`key={specimen.id}`) for reliable image rendering.\n   - Enhanced the specimen plate viewer with a zoom modal for full-resolution inspection.\n   - Upgraded the bottom specimen navigation tray with visual thumbnail previews for all 22 specimens across the 5 phyla (*Porifera*, *Cnidaria*, *Ctenophora*, *Platyhelminthes*, and *Nemathelminthes*).\n   - Added keyboard arrow navigation (`\342\206\220` / `\342\206\222`) to flip smoothly between specimen journal plates."
    modified_response: "The Field Guide section has been updated to correctly load and display every specimen\'s image:\n\n1. **Reactive Image Synchronization (`NaturalistImage.tsx`)**:\n   - Added `useEffect` listening to changes in `src` and `fallbackSrc`, ensuring that when flipping through specimens, the image container immediately loads the newly selected specimen\'s image rather than retaining the initial mount state.\n\n2. **Visual Folio Integration (`FieldGuidePage.tsx`)**:\n   - Wired each specimen plate directly to its respective image in `specimenImages` (`src/data/images.ts`).\n   - Added keyed re-mounting (`key={specimen.id}`) for reliable image rendering.\n   - Enhanced the specimen plate viewer with a zoom modal for full-resolution inspection.\n   - Upgraded the bottom specimen navigation tray with visual thumbnail previews for all 22 specimens across the 5 phyla (*Porifera*, *Cnidaria*, *Ctenophora*, *Platyhelminthes*, and *Nemathelminthes*).\n   - Added keyboard arrow navigation (`\342\206\220` / `\342\206\222`) to flip smoothly between specimen journal plates."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
    provider_assigned_message_id: "6924apDcGrjTxN8Pko6wwAI"
  }
}
